        {
            "title": "全日收市｜港股收升124點  內房及體品股揚升  一周計科指跌逾2%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">港股午後隨A股升幅收窄，恒指收升124點，內房及體育用品股揚升，聯想(00992)反彈，一周計恒指跌25點，科指跌逾2%。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：聯想官網影片截圖\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/11/bplib_20230705-135716_source-web_00992_source-web_-1.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：聯想官網影片截圖\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/11/bplib_20230705-135716_source-web_00992_source-web_-1.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：聯想官網影片截圖</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒生指數收市升幅收窄至124點或0.52%，報24,186，今早開升258點或1.08%，報24,321，早上見24,392，升330點或1.37%，為全日高位。下午隨A顯著向下，低見24,087，升25點或0.1%，為全日低位。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒生科技指數全日升47點或1.16%，報4,108，今早開升64點或1.59%，報4,125點;</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒生國企指數全日升24點或0.31%，報8,128，今早開升96點或1.19%，報8,199點。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">大市成交1,782.07億元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">全周計恒指跌25點或0.1%，科指跌89點或2.12%，國指跌19點或0.23%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">即月期指報24,370，升307點或1.28%，高水16點 ; 科指期貨升88點或2.17%，報4,150，高水4點; 國指期貨報8,197，升97點或1.2%，高水6點。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A股午後轉弱，深股收跌逾1%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">聯想(00992)午後升幅擴大，收升8.01%，報28.06元，為表現最佳藍籌股。阿里巴巴(09988)升2.26%，報108.8元 ; 騰訊(00700)報417.8元 ，無升跌 ; 快手(01024)升2.52%，報29.3元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">內房股領升，龍湖(00960)升6.21%，報5.045元，升幅藍籌股中居第二位 ; 華潤置地(01109)升3.33%，報31.06元 ; 融信中國(03301)大升8.82%，報0.074元，商品房改革進入全面落地期。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">生科股造好，百濟神州(06160)升4.36%，報225元 ;  信達生物(01801)升1.48%，報89.05元 ; 康諾亞(02162)升7.62%，報81.95元，旗下產品首三季收入升2.3倍。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">體育用品股也向好，李寧(02331)升3.91%，報13.28元 ; 安踏(02020)升3.31%，報77.95元。361度(01361)升5.95%，報4.9元。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/16988080-%e5%85%a8%e6%97%a5%e6%94%b6%e5%b8%82%ef%bd%9c%e6%b8%af%e8%82%a1%e6%94%b6%e5%8d%87124%e9%bb%9e-%e5%85%a7%e6%88%bf%e5%8f%8a%e9%ab%94%e5%93%81%e8%82%a1%e6%8f%9a%e5%8d%87-%e4%b8%80%e5%91%a8%e8%a8%88",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/HKSTOCK-5.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-10-16 16:47:37",
