        {
            "title": "A股午後轉差  深股收跌逾1%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A股午後轉弱，一度倒跌，深股收跌1%。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"A股 (AP圖片)\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/05/20250206_FI_source-ap_AShare-1.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"A股 (AP圖片)\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/05/20250206_FI_source-ap_AShare-1.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">A股 (AP圖片)</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">滬綜指全日報3,716，升8點或0.24%  ，上午高見3,750，升43點或1.2%，午後突然大幅向下，低見3,681，跌26點或0.7%，尾段略回升，成交7324.75億元(人民幣‧下同)</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">深成指全日報11,802，跌14點或0.12% ，最高見11,993，升177點或1.5%，成交8229.39億元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">滬綜指全周跌122點或3.2% ，深成指全周挫839點或6.64%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">創業板指數跌10點或0.36%，報2,772; 滬深300報4,170，升4點或0.11%。</p>\n</div>",
