            "title": "周生生第三季銷售按年增3%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">周生生(00116)公布，第三季度集團銷售值按年增長3%。內地同店銷售按年升4%，港澳升7%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">分店數目內地638間，港澳62家。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：周生生官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/08/20240828_FI_source-web_00116-1.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：周生生官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/08/20240828_FI_source-web_00116-1.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：周生生官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">公布稱，中國大陸市場持續受到審慎消費情緒、宏觀經濟不確定性及金價持續波動的影響。本季度黃金飾品及產品的需求仍保持正面，消費者需求持續傾向計價黃金飾品。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">與去年同期較高基數相比，中國大陸線上銷售之零售銷售值於本季度略有回落。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/16986175-%e5%91%a8%e7%94%9f%e7%94%9f%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%89%e5%ad%a3%e9%8a%b7%e5%94%ae%e6%8c%89%e5%b9%b4%e5%a2%9e3",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/05/20230726_FI_source-web_00116.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-10-16 13:04:33",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "半日收市｜港股半日升290點   內房股揚升",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">港股半日升290點，內房領升，生科及科技俱向好。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"shutterstock圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/05/20230724_FI_source_licensed_China-Property_shutterstock-1.png.webp\">\n<img alt=\"shutterstock圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/05/20230724_FI_source_licensed_China-Property_shutterstock-1.png.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">shutterstock圖片</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒生指數半日升290點或1.21%，報24,353，今早開升258點或1.08%，報24,321，中段見24,253，升191點或0.79%，為半日低位，其後向上，見24,392，升330點或1.37%，為半日高位。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒生科技指數半日升84點或2.09%，報4,145，今早開升64點或1.59%，報4,125點;</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒生國企指數半升88點或1.09%，報8,191，今早開升96點或1.19%，報8,199點。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">大市成交928.44億元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">即月期指報24,370，升307點或1.28%，高水16點 ; 科指期貨升88點或2.17%，報4,150，高水4點; 國指期貨報8,197，升97點或1.2%，高水6點。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">內房股領升，龍湖(00960)升9.05%，報5.18元，為表現最佳藍籌股，華潤置地(01109)升4.92%，報31.54元，升幅居第三位 ; 中海外(00688)升2.76%，報13.41元。融信中國(03301)大升10.29%，報0.075元，商品房改革進入全面落地期。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">生科股造好，百濟神州(06160)升5.94%，報228.4元，升幅藍籌股中居第二位 ; 石藥(01093)升1.64%，報9.01元。康諾亞(02162)升8.66%，報82.75元，旗下產品首三季收入升2.3倍。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">阿里巴巴(09988)升3.94%，報110.6元; 騰訊(00700)升1.25%，報423元 ; 聯想(00992)升3.7%，報26.94元。快手(01024)升4.83%，報29.96元。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/16986086-%e5%8d%8a%e6%97%a5%e6%94%b6%e5%b8%82%ef%bd%9c%e6%b8%af%e8%82%a1%e5%8d%8a%e6%97%a5%e5%8d%87290%e9%bb%9e-%e5%85%a7%e6%88%bf%e8%82%a1%e6%8f%9a%e5%8d%87",
